ct:</b> When leading your fellow Mages in examining a given Mystery, you can harmonize their Nimbuses with yours to mitigate the likelihood of occult tampering. When using Focused Mage Sight as a teamwork action, you add half your dots in this Merit, rounded up, to the number of teamwork rolls that are counted as a single Scrutiny roll.</div> </div> </div> </div> I like these. I would call the first Merit something simple like &quot;Focusing Apparatus&quot;.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-15T05:09:31-08:00","id":1032086,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GibberingEloquence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/885111-homebrew-mage-merits?p=1032085#post1032085\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> I like these. I would call the first Merit something simple like &amp;quot;Focusing Apparatus&amp;quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>Seems like too much of a mouthful. How about something shorter?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Hom